        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2194, Knurled Rectangular Passage Pocket Door Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Narrow Rectangular Passage Pocket Door Set features a unique knurled designed meant to match perfectly with all of Emtek Knurled Door Hardware. It comes packaged with two pulls--one for each side of the door--a mortise box, and all the mounting hardware.  The Knurled Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is one of the first with the knurled design, so you can be on the leading edge of modern home decor.  It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls and a passage mortise box with built in edge pull and is available in a wide selection of finishes ranging from classic to trendy, so you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2196-1215467\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2195-1215183\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-keyed-entry-pocket-door-set-emtek-2193-1215481\"><b>Keyed Entry Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Knurled Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Height: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3.43\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2194_2196-specifications.pdf?v=1774586581\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 2194 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a passage mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
